### 7.6 Receivable with a supplier (400)
POST {{host}}/api/companies/{{companyA}}/financial-entries
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "entryType": "RECEIVABLE",
  "supplierId": "{{finSupplier}}",
  "description": "Wrong partner",
  "amount": 10.00,
